Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.38,0:22:00.30,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.01,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被愛
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.01,0:22:08.39,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.85,0:22:12.10,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.15,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.79,0:22:31.29,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.29,0:22:34.42,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.46,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.63,0:22:44.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在過去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.26,0:22:51.06,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.06,0:22:53.39,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.39,0:22:56.52,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.52,0:23:02.49,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.61,0:23:06.62,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.32,0:23:09.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.58,0:23:20.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.38,0:22:00.30,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.01,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.01,0:22:08.39,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.85,0:22:12.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.15,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.79,0:22:31.29,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.29,0:22:34.42,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.46,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.63,0:22:44.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.26,0:22:51.06,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.06,0:22:53.39,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.39,0:22:56.52,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.52,0:23:02.49,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.61,0:23:06.62,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.32,0:23:09.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.58,0:23:20.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:22:00.30,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.01,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:08.39,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:12.10,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.90,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.86,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.15,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.36,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.91,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.79,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.79,0:22:31.29,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:34.42,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.46,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:44.72,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}留在過去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.26,0:22:51.06,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:53.39,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:56.52,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:23:02.49,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.61,0:23:06.62,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:09.66,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.58,0:23:20.34,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:22:00.30,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.01,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:08.39,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:12.10,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.90,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.86,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.15,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.36,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.91,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.79,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.79,0:22:31.29,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:34.42,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.46,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ありのままじゃない自分を
